{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_08",
  "title": "月光沉淪",
  "storyCode": "TW-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "941f4e46b8e4dfea061a96c88f1415d9754fa2ad161253a8364d0411fd52105e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 8上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民A",
      "text": "塔佳娜！最後一個“留聲機”被破壞了！我們沒有手段對付那些巨人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "欸！那些暴徒開始燒房子了！該死，他們......火勢在蔓延！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "喂，塔佳娜，塞弗林呢！這種關鍵時候，他在哪裡！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "塞弗林長官他......他受了傷，他正在休息......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民A",
      "text": "都什麼時候了還休息！？我們可是冒著生命危險——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "閉嘴！現在不是吵架的時候，沒看我們處於劣勢嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民A",
      "text": "那你的法術有用嗎！？廢物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "別、別吵了！控制好各自的管轄區域，防禦性的源石技藝必須保證——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "東邊！東邊的術師倒下了！快換一個頂上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "小心——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民A",
      "text": "火——！火燒過來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "救——救命啊啊啊——啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民A",
      "text": "快、快滅火！有沒有可以滅火的術師！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "救——疼，疼啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民B",
      "text": "塔佳娜——救——我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "啊......啊啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "清晰的字句很快被單純的慘叫遮掩。\n皮膚烤焦的味道，比任何惡劣的玩笑都要讓人膽寒。\n被火焰包裹著的人逐漸失去形貌，只留下黑影似的肉體......\n焦黑的皮膚和血，他掙扎著開口——\n他很痛苦，他請求我幫助他。\n但是——\n但是——托爾當時，也是這樣痛苦的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "塔佳娜！！別恍神了，你離太遠了！小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "好機會！你也一起被燒死吧！貴族的寵物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "混亂。這座城鎮從來都不是上下一心的，就像蛋糕，切成一塊一塊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "現在，那最後的一塊也將要變成一盤散沙，他們毫無力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "就算我們收手，就算我們撤退，他們當真能活下來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "萊塔尼亞必然會棄他們於不顧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "離這裡最近的兩座移動城邦，二十四座高塔，沒有一個大人物能俯瞰到冬靈山脈裡垂死掙扎的小城鎮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "——悲哀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我們曾是厭倦了這種悲哀，而站在這裡，不要忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "不要試圖自作主張。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......當然。誒，你平時怎麼不這麼講話呢？我只是抱怨抱怨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "抱怨我們等待隱忍了那麼久，最後的結果也沒什麼變化，事情還是變得很糟糕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "只是一點不甘心的......牢騷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "他們要衝進來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "——唔！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "我，我來幫忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "該死！好不容易轟開的缺口！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "那個沃爾珀是哪兒來的！？她、她怎麼有九條尾巴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "不對！你也是感染者！你為什麼要站在那裡！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "這麼小的年紀——你的不幸和痛苦，難道就不該反抗嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "同胞！反抗他們！不要被騙了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "他們才是壓榨我們欺壓我們的罪人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "你——在說什麼啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "把、把他們給震飛了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "她周圍的源石技藝反應變慢了？這是哪個國家的法術，書上沒有教過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "不要隨便就決定別人的命運啊，羅德島的前輩們，還有爸爸媽媽，大家都對我很好啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "還有你們！不要偷偷溜過去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "唔——！？身、身體......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "不要——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "——總是不顧後果地讓事情變成最壞的情況啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......現在你打算怎麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "畢德曼......罪魁禍首已經死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "斷崖和卡達回來之前，我們還沒有確實的證據......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......那麼真凶到底是誰？在我眼前發生的是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "現在沒空討論這個問題，至少先鎮壓這場暴亂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——亞葉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "我......我不知道該怎麼做......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......我理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "一個救治感染者的醫師，卻死在感染者暴亂之中的那種荒唐和無力感......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我曾比任何人......都為之憤恨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "為什麼、為什麼一定要這樣？大家不都知道現在的情況嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "自相殘殺沒有好處！大家會一起遭殃的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "給我讓開！否則就算你是小孩，我也不會讓你好受的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "——我不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "你們應該聽我說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "那你想說什麼？要從頭開始梳理誰對誰錯嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "你覺得是什麼把我們逼到這個份上的？時代、國家、人心，什麼都很糟糕，自以為有些想法的人都會這麼說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "可是，假如現在你走在路上，有一個暴徒持刀攔路，逼問你他該如何活下去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "這個時候你要從哪裡說起？從萊塔尼亞的腐敗制度，還是雷姆必拓的血腥開拓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "呃——！快要支撐——不住——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "他想的是怎麼殺了你開闢一條生路，而你想的是要立刻開火還是想辦法拉開距離再開火——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "想要活下去的大部分時候，事實就這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "總有一些渺小的人要犧牲，恰好都是我們這樣的人，而不是你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "你們高枕無憂，暢談理想，譴責時代，把話題變大，把敵人變遙遠，來逃避近在眼前的問題——哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "——有效果了！繼續衝擊防線！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "......可大家都是無辜的......感染者也不是自己樂意才......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "無辜？呸，我才不想取得同情，我們都不是無辜的。去他媽的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "我們只是要活下去，哪怕讓其他人活不下去，在活命這方面，沒有人是搞慈善的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "喂！那個沃爾珀好像快不行了，九條尾巴的那隻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "趕緊瞄準她！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "text": "噫——法、法杖斷了？從哪兒來的弩箭！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我們來幫忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "斷崖和卡達應該在外圍疏散被捲入的民眾，至於我們就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——亞葉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......整合運動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "我確實聽見，人群之中有在高喊，整合運動解放了他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "但他們不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "不——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "失去了主心骨，這場暴亂自會瓦解！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "說到底，要不是因為他們，安托怎麼會——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "亞葉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "冷靜點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "這對你來說並不是第一次了，對我來說......也一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "我有點......不知所措。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......上吧，羅德島要想辦法阻止這場暴亂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......是羅德島，你寄予厚望的，就是這幾個孩子而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "他們還不成熟，他們沒來得及阻止這一切，已經晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......但他們，已是戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "嚯——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "戰士，已經走上了戰場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "讓其他人退下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我們上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲一把扯下了整合運動的標誌，她揚起手，岩石瓦解，又再度匯聚。\n戰場陷入寂靜，暴亂者們自覺地讓出道路，抗爭者則因為膽怯而後退。\n只見她向前，邁出了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
